timestamp=2026-09-26T19:31:55.640Z level=INFO run=01b4c3ae message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 - <<'PY'\np='faillock.conf'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\n\"\"\"# --- Even counts (root) ---\"\"\",\n\"\"\"# --- Admin exemption ---\n# Treat members of `wheel` the same as the root account: since\n# even_deny_root is not enabled, they are not subject to lockout at all.\n# This is the pam_faillock feature that guarantees the primary admin is\n# never locked out of the machine. Requested 2026-09-26.\n#\n# Tradeoff, stated once: a remote attacker guessing THIS account's password\n# is also never locked out. The only remaining control is password strength\n# plus fail2ban/firewall rate limiting. Combined with unlock_time=30 below,\n# faillock provides effectively no lockout protection for this account —\n# which is the requested behaviour, not an oversight.\nadmin_group = wheel\n\n# --- Even counts (root) ---\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nprint(\"  [✓] admin_group=wheel added\")\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
