timestamp=2026-09-26T20:50:14.604Z level=INFO run=501861cf message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="buildlog note \"1-day fail2ban lockout was ALREADY live: bantime=86400 on sshd + recidive jails in /etc/fail2ban/jail.d/shield-kitty.conf, matches repo. firewalld is now active with the workstation zone, so firewallcmd-rich-rules bans ARE enforceable. Fixed stale docs in unban-self.sh + fail2ban-coverage.md that wrongly claimed bantime=-1 permanent (89506fc)\" 2>&1" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
