timestamp=2026-09-26T21:31:15.616Z level=INFO run=501861cf message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="git add -A" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
timestamp=2026-09-26T21:31:15.616Z level=INFO run=501861cf message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="git commit -q -m \"fix: scan service ran as root, and installer truncated the live datafile\n\nTwo defects that the 'active (running)' status had been hiding.\n\n1. arpwatch-spoof-scan.service had no User=, so it inherited root. The scanner\n   bootstraps a session bus and resolves XDG_RUNTIME_DIR from its own uid, which\n   as root is /run/user/0 -- a bus that does not exist. Notifications would have\n   failed silently while the scan reported healthy, which is the worst kind of\n   failure: the log says it worked. Now User=livings with XDG_RUNTIME_DIR and\n   DBUS_SESSION_BUS_ADDRESS set explicitly, since a system unit inherits neither\n   and the bootstrap is only a fallback.\n\n2. install-arpwatch-spoof.sh ran 'install /dev/null \\$DB' unconditionally, which\n   TRUNCATES arp.dat. Every re-run of the installer destroyed all collected\n   addresses, and it was doing so to a file the running collector appends to.\n   That is also why the datafile looked absent. Now created only when missing,\n   and the existing one is reported with its entry count.\n\nAlso required for (1): /var/lib/arpwatch was 0750 root:root, which locks\nlivings out of the directory entirely regardless of the datafile's own mode.\nNow 0755, with spoof-state created 0644 owned by livings so the scanner can\nrewrite its dedup state. A root-owned state file would fail the write, which the\nscanner only logs, and then it would re-alert on every single run.\n\nAnd set WorkingDirectory=/var/lib/arpwatch on the collector: arpwatch chdir()s\nto /usr/arpwatch, which does not exist, and falls back to the working directory\n-- which for a system unit is /.\n\nChecked all four permission paths by hand, since verifying this properly needs\nroot. All three units pass systemd-analyze verify.\"" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
